OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAnother showery day today, with
OL,6,Fsome showers possibly thundery and
OL,7,Fbringing hail, occasionally merging
OL,8,Finto longer spells of rain. Sunny
OL,9,Fintervals are likely between showers,
OL,10,Fand it will feel fresher than recently.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FShowers gradually easing this
OL,13,Fevening, although a few may continue
OL,14,Fovernight, especially towards the
OL,15,Fnorth and west. Clearer skies will
OL,16,Fbring a chilly night, especially in
OL,17,Frural areas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
