OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FA dry, bright day with sunny
OL,6,Fspells and patches of fair weather
OL,7,Fcloud. After a cool start,
OL,8,Ftemperatures will rise to around
OL,9,Faverage in the sunshine.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FDry
OL,12,Fwith sunny spells on Sunday and
OL,13,FMonday, before showers and perhaps
OL,14,Fthunderstorms develop overnight and
OL,15,Finto Tuesday. Feeling warmer,
OL,16,Fparticularly in the sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
